{"title": "Release", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">214 Release</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-images\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Preview\">Preview</div><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Icon\">Icon</div><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab\" data-druid=\"1-3\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In space\">In space</div></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-files\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Preview\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ReleasePreView.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"ReleasePreView.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/ReleasePreView.png/250px-ReleasePreView.png?b981ee\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ReleasePreView.png/375px-ReleasePreView.png?b981ee 1.5x, /images/thumb/ReleasePreView.png/500px-ReleasePreView.png?b981ee 2x\" data-file-width=\"881\" data-file-height=\"881\" /></a></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"Icon\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Release_(Icon).png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Release (Icon).png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Release_%28Icon%29.png/250px-Release_%28Icon%29.png?cd3928\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"/images/Release_%28Icon%29.png?cd3928 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable\" data-druid=\"1-3\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In space\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Release_in_space.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Release in space.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Release_in_space.jpg/250px-Release_in_space.jpg?bf8885\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Release_in_space.jpg/375px-Release_in_space.jpg?bf8885 1.5x, /images/thumb/Release_in_space.jpg/500px-Release_in_space.jpg?bf8885 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-LevelInformation\">Level Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Price\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Price\">Price</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Price druid-data-nonempty\">\n&#9646;1750</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-HazardLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-HazardLevel\">Hazard Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-HazardLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\nS</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SupportedWeather(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SupportedWeather(s)\">Supported Weather(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SupportedWeather(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nRainy, Foggy, Stormy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, Hurricane, Minefield</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-TerrainforCruiser\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-TerrainforCruiser\">Terrain for Cruiser?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-TerrainforCruiser druid-data-nonempty\">\nNot at all</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Technical\">Technical</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorSizeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorSizeMultiplier\">Interior Size Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorSizeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.5</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorsSpawnChances\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorsSpawnChances\">Interiors Spawn Chances</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorsSpawnChances druid-data-nonempty\">\nFacility: 0.03%<br />Mansion: 0.0001%<br />Mineshaft: 0.0001%<br />Atlantean Citadel: 0.001%<br />Carnival: 0.0001%<br /><b>Expanded Facility: 99.96%</b><br />Greenhouse: 0.0003%<br />Rubber Rooms: 0.004%</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MinimumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MinimumScrap\">Minimum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MinimumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n30</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaximumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaximumScrap\">Maximum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaximumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n39</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SpikeTraps\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SpikeTraps\">Spike Traps</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SpikeTraps druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 0</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Turrets\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 7</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 84</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nBunker Spider, Hoarding Bug, Hygrodere</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nFeiopar, Forest Keeper, Giant Sapsucker</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\n13</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n12</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n16</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tocleft\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Map\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Map</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Info\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Info</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Environment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Environment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Weather\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Weather</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Time_Multiplier\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Time Multiplier</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Trial:_Reshape_The_Incapable\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trial: Reshape The Incapable</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Progression\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Progression</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Unlocked_By\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocked By</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Unlocks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocks</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Loot_Table\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Loot Table</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Entities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Entities</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime_Enemies)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Solover&#39;s_Recording\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solover's Recording</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Reshape_The_Incapable_(Release_Videotape)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reshape The Incapable (Release Videotape)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>A moon with lush and dense forests, it remained mostly untouched until ownership was transferred to the <b>Trite Control Corporation</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/File:ReleaseMap.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"ReleaseMap.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/ReleaseMap.jpg/650px-ReleaseMap.jpg?9b89c9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"650\" height=\"365\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ReleaseMap.jpg/975px-ReleaseMap.jpg?9b89c9 1.5x, /images/thumb/ReleaseMap.jpg/1300px-ReleaseMap.jpg?9b89c9 2x\" data-file-width=\"1919\" data-file-height=\"1079\" /></a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Abandoned<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Cold. Moist. Mildly foggy. Highly populated by dense forests.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> Dominated by a few species.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<div class=\"ambox\" style=\"--ambox-color: #0094FF;\"><div class=\"ambox-icon metadata\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/48px-Information.png?c7ec8d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/72px-Information.png?c7ec8d 1.5x, https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/96px-Information.png?c7ec8d 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"ambox-content\"><p class=\"ambox-title\">Unfinished Section</p><p class=\"ambox-text\">This section seems unfinished. If you're a wiki editor, please help with completing this section.</p></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p>Release can experience Rainy, Foggy, Stormy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, Hurricane, or Minefield weather by default.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Time_Multiplier\">Time Multiplier</span></h3>\n<p>This moon has a default day speed multiplier of 0.7, meaning the player can stay on the moon for longer.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trial:_Reshape_The_Incapable\">Trial: Reshape The Incapable</span></h3>\n<p>This moon features a trial to complete that generates with the Expanded Facility interior. Completing it rewards the player with scrap worth a total of at least \u25ae360. <b>The specific rewards</b> are <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>the scrap \"Bloodied diamond\" and \"Reshape the incapable ticket\".</span></span>\n</p><p><big>To complete this trial:</big>\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Though not required until the final step, it is advised to find a door with a sign that says \"RESHAPE THE INCAPABLE\" and remember its location.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Find a room with an employee trapped in a machine and remember its location.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Find and return three \"Machine parts\" scrap to this room and insert them into the machine. These parts spawn in smaller server rooms with shelving units behind electrical gates. These electrical gates will deal 99 hp to the player if they walk through them while holding machine parts. The intended method to avoid taking damage is to place the parts onto a small platform, walk through the electrical gate and around to the other side of the platform, and rotate the platform to safely transport the parts. However, dropping the parts near the electrical gate, walking through the gate, and grabbing the parts from the other side is much simpler.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Press the red button in the room with the employee, grab the gas can underneath it, and find a generator within the interior to fuel with the gas. The generator typically spawns in rooms adjacent to catwalks with a sign saying \"BACKUP POWER\".</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Return to the room with the employee, press the red button again, and wait.<br />6. Once the employee has been \"reshaped\" and a loud buzzer sound plays, return to the door in step 1. It will now be opened.</span></span></li></ol>\n<p><b>Additionally</b>, completing this trial can reward the player with <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>two different destiny items that can be inserted into the destiny item slot in the abandoned ship on <a href=\"/wiki/Repress\" title=\"Repress\">Repress</a>.</span></span>\n</p><p><b>Ending 5:</b> Turn on the TV in the room after beating the trial and watch. <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>The destiny item \"Secret Coordinates\" will spawn in the machine next to the TV afterward.</span></span>\n</p><p><b>Ending 6:</b> The player must have previously completed the trials on <a href=\"/wiki/Crowd\" title=\"Crowd\">Crowd</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Narcotic\" title=\"Narcotic\">Narcotic</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Descent\" title=\"Descent\">Descent</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Extort\" title=\"Extort\">Extort</a> to get their respective tickets as rewards. In the room after completing the trial, insert all five tickets, including Release's ticket acquired in this room, into the machine to left of the TV as prompted before turning on the TV. <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>The destiny item \"Very secret Coordinates\" will spawn in the machine shortly after turning on the TV. Submitting any less than all five tickets will result in Ending 5.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Inserting the \"Reshape the incapable\" videotape that spawns randomly as scrap within the interior of <a href=\"/wiki/Extort\" title=\"Extort\">Extort</a> into the projector in <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\">Galetry</a>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Hyve\" title=\"Hyve\"><big><b>Hyve:</b></big></a> A breakable hive has a chance to spawn directly north of the ship at the top of the hill in front of the fire exit, spawning the <b>Hyve videotape</b> when broken.</span></span><br /><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/End\" title=\"End\"><big><b>End:</b></big></a> Acquiring the destiny item \"Secret Coordinates\" or \"Very secret Coordinates\" and placing it into the destiny item slot before taking off in the abandoned ship on <a href=\"/wiki/Repress\" title=\"Repress\">Repress</a>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Airhorn</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Airhorn.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Airhorn.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Airhorn.png/60px-Airhorn.png?6146f4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Airhorn.png/90px-Airhorn.png?6146f4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Airhorn.png/120px-Airhorn.png?6146f4 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>62</td>\n<td>72</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>2.97%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Big bolt</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Big_bolt.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Big bolt.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/60px-Big_bolt.png