>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2.14%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Lore\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Lore\">&gt; Lore</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Solover.27s_Recording\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solover's_Recording\">Solover's Recording</span></h3>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"36\" data-mwtitle=\"SoloverTalking1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/SoloverTalking1.mp3?6ba430\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/SoloverTalking1.mp3/SoloverTalking1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">They have to be perfect, we cannot bathe in a stew of mediocrity if we wish to thrive in our future. With slight alterations, one perfect specimen might be worth a hundred regulars in action. The process might be slow but we require patience. An empire built in a day will end in one too. We must be patient, build our machines. Then watch as we bring order and end this quiet age.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span id=\"Reshape_The_Incapable_.28Release_Videotape.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reshape_The_Incapable_(Release_Videotape)\">Reshape The Incapable (Release Videotape)</span></h3>\n<p><b>This videotape</b> can be found on <a href=\"/wiki/Extort\" title=\"Extort\">Extort</a> only.\n</p><p><video poster=\"/images/thumb/ReleaseTape2.mp4/500px--ReleaseTape2.mp4.jpg?e97f2f\" controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" class=\"thumbborder\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" data-durationhint=\"37\" data-mwtitle=\"ReleaseTape2.mp4\" data-mwprovider=\"local\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:100%;height:100%\"><source src=\"/images/ReleaseTape2.mp4?e97f2f\" type=\"video/mp4; codecs=&quot;avc1.42E01E, mp4a.40.2&quot;\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" /></video>\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">Restructure requires heavy adjustments, and for the future of our civilisation I must push you into our river. It is time for you to prove yourself to me. We reshape the worthless into something valuable. Reshape this failure into a usable asset, show what you've learnt and I will let you in.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Before <b>Obscurity</b>, <b>Solover's Recording</b> was referred to as <b>Old Signal</b> and had different audio and text.</li></ul>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"27\" data-mwtitle=\"OldRadio.wav\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/OldRadio.wav?a3dafd\" type=\"audio/wav\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/OldRadio.wav/OldRadio.wav.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/OldRadio.wav/OldRadio.wav.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-transcodekey=\"mp3\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">I need them perfect.<br />We cannot bathe in a stew of mediocrity. If we want to reclaim our future. One perfect specimen is worth a hundred regulars in action...<br />Just with slight alterations.<br />The process is slow but will all be worth it. And I will be they\u2019re god.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li>Before <b>\"Obscurity\"</b> video material on \"Reshape the incapable\" videotape was different:<br /><br /><video poster=\"/images/thumb/ReleaseTape.mp4/300px--ReleaseTape.mp4.jpg?413a27\" controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" class=\"thumbborder\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" data-durationhint=\"35\" data-mwtitle=\"ReleaseTape.mp4\" data-mwprovider=\"local\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:100%;height:100%\"><source src=\"/images/ReleaseTape.mp4?413a27\" type=\"video/mp4; codecs=&quot;avc1.42E01E, mp4a.40.2&quot;\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" /></video><br /></li></ul>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">Restructure requires large adjustments, and for the future of our civilisation I want you to jump. It is time for you to prove yourself to me. We reshape the worthless into something valuable. Reshape this failure into a usable asset, show what you've learnt and I will let you out.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<div class=\"ambox\" style=\"--ambox-color: #0094FF;\"><div class=\"ambox-icon metadata\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/48px-Information.png?c7ec8d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/72px-Information.png?c7ec8d 1.5x, https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/96px-Information.png?c7ec8d 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"ambox-content\"><p class=\"ambox-title\">Unfinished Section</p><p class=\"ambox-text\">This section seems unfinished. If you're a wiki editor, please help with completing this section.</p></div></div></div>", "images": ["ReleasePreView.png", "Release_(Icon).png", "Release_in_space.jpg", "ReleaseMap.jpg", "Information.png", "Airhorn.png", "Big_bolt.png", "Bottles.png", "Candy.png", "Cash_register.png", "Clock.png", "Clown_horn.png", "Control_pad.png", "Dust_pan.png", "Flask.png", "Gift.png", "Gold_bar.png", "Golden_cup.png", "GunkfishPlushiePH.png", "Homemade_flashbang.png", "HomemadeSporeEmitterPH.png", "Jar_of_pickles.png", "Laser_pointer.png", "LegallyDistinctBatleyPH.png", "Maneater_plushie.png", "Plastic_fish.png", "Ring.png", "(Ingredient)_Rubber_roll.png", "Silent_package.png", "(Lore)_Old_signal.png", "(Ingredient)_Steel_ingot.png", "Stop_sign.png", "Toy_cube.png", "Toy_robot.png", "Toy_train.png", "Webley.png", "SoloverTalking1.mp3", "ReleaseTape2.mp4", "OldRadio.wav", "ReleaseTape.mp4"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes", "Pages_with_spoilers", "Moons"]}